Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One Slash from my Guardian's\NAxe and this duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye to the rest\Nof your life points, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Grawl, attack with Gravity Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibu Brothers, activate Star Defense!\NWhat do you think? What do you look?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was stopped by a bunch of fuzzballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks can be quite deceiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Karibo brothers are more\Npowerful than they appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:02:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With nothing between you and my monster\Nbut a pack of gerbils, I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty even, so I don't think\Nwe missed anything too exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why do we have to sit\Nover here in the chief seats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can make it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This map's all wrong, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've looked at every inch\Nand there's no bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try looking ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think this bridge was\Nmeant for large automobiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, what gave that away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it, Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Real smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.95,0:03:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me turn this car around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still kind of confused\Nabout one thing, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something my gramp said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In the museum, he told us\Nthat there are two Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,See, there's really just one Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But he sort of has this other side to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's like a\Ntougher, more confident Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I like his sweet and charming side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He was such a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The tie's a friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I never met anyone as nice as Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I suppose he needs the tougher\Nside of his personality also.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When they work together, there's\Nnothing that can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're probably beating the\Npants off that biker creep right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about my purity\Nof the cemetery magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like you're in\Nover your head, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is better than Revenge\Nof the Mummy, part four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,His monster is way more\Npowerful than any of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pot of Greed lets me draw\Ntwo cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over yet, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a card in our deck that\Ncould help us turn things around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need to draw it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I activate the Karibo\NBrothers' special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,merging them into Curry Babylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sacrifice this new beast\Nto summon something stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,By combining his five\Npowder puffs together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,he can sacrifice them for a real monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my new monster! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too weak, do the math.\NMy guardian will crush her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The great beast will\Nreturn He must be stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,before he is fully restored\NTime is running out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised we'd help her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only do we owe it to\Nthe dark magician girl We
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,owe it to the world Behold\NRaphael My legendary dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the Eye of Tomaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, fuse with my Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Dark Magician\NGirl, the Dragon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi always pulls the card\Nhe needs at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Although somehow that never seems\Nto work for guys like you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my all-powerful dragon,\NI'm in control of this duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack my beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dragon knight has less attack\Npoints than my guardian grarl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but my monster\Nhas a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By discarding one card to my graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I allow my dragon to destroy\Nyour monster instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with Dark Energy Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be so lucky next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate self-tribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've given up a thousand life\Npoints to save my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Raphael wasn't\Nkidding when he said
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd do anything to protect his monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shocking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That a duelist can have so much respect\Nand appreciation for his monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I actually\Ncare about my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You abandon yours as soon\Nas a better one comes along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I value all of my cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you're as disrespectful\Nas everyone else, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Let's do it. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you upset because I know you\Nbetter than you know yourself? Face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,every person in the world has darkness\Nin their heart, and you're no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your problem is you're afraid to\Nadmit it, but deep down, you're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's been like this\Nfor the last 10,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to live in paradise, but\Nthen the ancient stone showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What ancient stone are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the Stone of Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It came to test us and most of us failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stone unlocked the darkness that\Nwas buried in the hearts of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few turned out to be pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge battle broke out between good and\Nevil, and in the end, the evil side won.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever told you that\Nstory is lying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The only evil is around your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That stone is nothing but bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone of Orikalkos simply\Nshows us the truth, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That the majority of the world is\Nheartless and evil. You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard your memories were erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, how do you know\Nyou weren't an evil Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not remember much\Nabout my days as pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know that I once saved mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:10:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the people you saved were evil,\Nwhich means you are too. That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years before you ruled as king,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the stone of Orikalkos\Nappeared and never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The world was divided into two sides, the\Npure of heart and those ruled by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The two sides faced off in the most\Ndevastating battle the world's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to continue that fight\Nand make sure our side wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And while we may be outnumbered,\Nwe have two things you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Orichalcos\Nand the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we can capture the souls\Nof man and offer them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to the most powerful\Nbeast that ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will the world return to the way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a peaceful place\Nwith a worthy leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been brainwashed. Take a\Nlook around. If things continue, the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,way they are The entire planet's gonna\Nlook like this desert Desolate, crumbling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and void of any signs\Nof life But that's not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna happen. Because I'll\Nsee to it that justice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is served, and you're\Ngonna help me. You see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh after 5,000 years\Nyour spirit did come back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can save the world\Nby surrendering your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,soul no that's a lie\Nenough I'm sick of hearing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you justify your evil\Nplan I'm afraid it isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my plan I'm carrying out\Nthe wishes of my master
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is this master of yours, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for starters, he's a\Nbetter leader than you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My master told me all about your\Nhistory as the king of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How you ruled as an evil dictator,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,using the power of the Shadow\NRealm to control your subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! He lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no memory of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So isn't it possible that you're\Nresponsible for the destruction of Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I was a worthy pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who locked\Nthe dark magic away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you take a closer look at\Nyourself, you'll discover the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart is dark, and\NI'm about to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally Exchange allows both of us to\Npick a card from our opponent's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll notice we each\Nhave only one card left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means we switch cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Necromancy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me use a monster\Nfrom your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That means this card was\Nuseless to you anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,since I have no monsters\Nin my graveyard. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hand me your card so we can continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll be pretty\Npleased with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you find so amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,oh no i can't use this not the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,seal of orichalcos it's too late the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,stone around your neck has already\Nbegun to reveal your dark side
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:13:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oracle never lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since it first appeared on Earth,\Nthe stone's been testing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It knows who the evil ones are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it detects the\Ndarkness inside of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,for the first time in centuries,\Nyou'll get to see who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you don't have to activate\Nthat card if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a feeling you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and make\Nyour next move, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, you can't use\Nthat card! Yes, but... But nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That card is evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget my purity of the cemetery\Nmagic card is still in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And with five monsters in your graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you automatically lose\N500 of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:15:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl the\NDragon Knight, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate his guardian again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Crystal Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sealed your dragon\Nin a crystal prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,just like he was when you first found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big shot dragon is locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, there is one card in your\Nhand that could set your monster free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you man enough to play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to force us to\Nplay the seal of Ori Kalkos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That card is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't\Nactivate it, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Yuki, but it could be the\Nonly way to free Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon a face-down\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he wants to use\Nthe Seal of Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Rod of Silence
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It raises my backup\NGardner's strength by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It also lets me play my Guardian Chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Grarl, attack\Nhis face-down monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm defenseless, and your\Nlife points are wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Guardian K-Est, attack him directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this duel's just about over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you'll automatically\Nlose when your next turn's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, my purity of the cemetery's still\Nin effect, so you lose 600 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have one turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to save yourself,\Nand you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now play the card I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Pharaoh! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another way out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose now, then two\Nworlds will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I activate my card of sanctity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of us must draw from our decks\Nuntil we have six cards in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of options.\NThere's only one card in my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,hand that can free my\Ndragon So I can win the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must play the seal of Orekalkos
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go No, you don't know what\Nyou're doing Let go Listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.19,0:18:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is affecting your mind. We're\Ngoing to lose the duel. Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.05,0:18:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't play that card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the seal of Aurichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.03,0:19:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that light what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Orykalkos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you had it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what the\NObelisk reveals about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you good or are you evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, how do you feel?
